{"id":"53d1e79be3c06aa5","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-chern-simons.md","title":"Parameterized Chern–Simons Functional","display":"df-chern-simons — Parameterized Chern–Simons Functional","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-chern-simons","aliases":["58-df-chern-simons"],"display":"df-chern-simons — Parameterized Chern–Simons Functional","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-chern-simons"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-chern-simons</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-chern-simons — Parameterized Chern–Simons Functional"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ec1809e41ec24c81\" href=\"?note=ec1809e41ec24c81\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch11/58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,G,\\cdot_G,e_G,\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g},\\Omega^2_{\\mathfrak g},\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R}\\in V\">\\(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,G,\\cdot_G,e_G,\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g},\\Omega^2_{\\mathfrak g},\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R}\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_1,q_{12},q_{111},+_3,\\odot_3,\\mathcal I_M,\\operatorname{csform},\\mathrm{CS}_M\\in V\">\\(d_1,q_{12},q_{111},+_3,\\odot_3,\\mathcal I_M,\\operatorname{csform},\\mathrm{CS}_M\\in V\\)</span> are explicit differential-form, contraction, integration, and functional maps.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are the predicates from the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChernSimonsData}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ChernSimonsData}_S\\)</span> is the predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chern\\text{-}simons}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ChernSimonsData}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,G,\\cdot_G,e_G,\n\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g},\\Omega^2_{\\mathfrak g},\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R},\nd_1,q_{12},q_{111},+_3,\\odot_3,\\mathcal I_M,\\operatorname{csform},\\mathrm{CS}_M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,3)\n\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\n\\land e_G\\in G\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;(e_G\\cdot_G g=g\\land g\\cdot_G e_G=g)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d_1,\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g},\\Omega^2_{\\mathfrak g})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q_{12},\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g}\\times\\Omega^2_{\\mathfrak g},\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q_{111},(\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g})^3,\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_3,\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R}\\times\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R},\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_3,\\mathbb R\\times\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R},\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal I_M,\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{csform},\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g},\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathrm{CS}_M,\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g},\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\in\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g}\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{csform}(A)=q_{12}(A,d_1(A))+_3\\bigl(\\tfrac23\\odot_3q_{111}(A,A,A)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{CS}_M(A)=\\tfrac1{8\\pi^2}\\mathcal I_M(\\operatorname{csform}(A))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chern\\text{-}simons}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ChernSimonsData}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,G,\\cdot_G,e_G,\n\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g},\\Omega^2_{\\mathfrak g},\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R},\nd_1,q_{12},q_{111},+_3,\\odot_3,\\mathcal I_M,\\operatorname{csform},\\mathrm{CS}_M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,3)\n\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\n\\land e_G\\in G\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;(e_G\\cdot_G g=g\\land g\\cdot_G e_G=g)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d_1,\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g},\\Omega^2_{\\mathfrak g})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q_{12},\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g}\\times\\Omega^2_{\\mathfrak g},\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q_{111},(\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g})^3,\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_3,\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R}\\times\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R},\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_3,\\mathbb R\\times\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R},\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal I_M,\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{csform},\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g},\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathrm{CS}_M,\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g},\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\in\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g}\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{csform}(A)=q_{12}(A,d_1(A))+_3\\bigl(\\tfrac23\\odot_3q_{111}(A,A,A)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{CS}_M(A)=\\tfrac1{8\\pi^2}\\mathcal I_M(\\operatorname{csform}(A))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The oriented atlas, group law and identity, form carriers, trace-wedge contractions, exterior derivative, and integration map are explicit; the functional is not indexed only by the bare carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"ec1809e41ec24c81","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,G,\\cdot_G,e_G,\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g},\\Omega^2_{\\mathfrak g},\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"d_1,q_{12},q_{111},+_3,\\odot_3,\\mathcal I_M,\\operatorname{csform},\\mathrm{CS}_M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ChernSimonsData}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chern\\text{-}simons}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ChernSimonsData}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,G,\\cdot_G,e_G,\n\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g},\\Omega^2_{\\mathfrak g},\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R},\nd_1,q_{12},q_{111},+_3,\\odot_3,\\mathcal I_M,\\operatorname{csform},\\mathrm{CS}_M)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,3)\n\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\n\\land e_G\\in G\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;(e_G\\cdot_G g=g\\land g\\cdot_G e_G=g)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d_1,\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g},\\Omega^2_{\\mathfrak g})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q_{12},\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g}\\times\\Omega^2_{\\mathfrak g},\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q_{111},(\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g})^3,\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R})\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_3,\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R}\\times\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R},\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_3,\\mathbb R\\times\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R},\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R})\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal I_M,\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{csform},\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g},\\Omega^3_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathrm{CS}_M,\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g},\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\in\\Omega^1_{\\mathfrak g}\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{csform}(A)=q_{12}(A,d_1(A))+_3\\bigl(\\tfrac23\\odot_3q_{111}(A,A,A)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{CS}_M(A)=\\tfrac1{8\\pi^2}\\mathcal I_M(\\operatorname{csform}(A))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":2528,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-273","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-chern-simons.md|58-df-chern-simons]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["ec1809e41ec24c81","ed71f39f59370734","36d7463d215be751"]}